# Medical Disclaimer

## Educational Purpose

The **Diabetes Metabolic Model** is an educational project created to improve the understanding of physiological processes associated with diabetes mellitus.

The information presented in this repository is intended solely for educational and informational purposes.

It should not be interpreted as medical advice, clinical guidance, or a recommendation for diagnosis or treatment.

---

## No Medical Advice

This project does **not** replace:

* consultation with an endocrinologist;
* consultation with a physician;
* individualized medical treatment;
* professional nutritional counseling;
* clinical decision-making.

Every person living with diabetes has unique medical needs, and treatment should always be determined by qualified healthcare professionals.

---

## Personal Experience

Parts of this model have been inspired by the author's personal experience living with diabetes, together with publicly available physiological knowledge and generally accepted medical concepts.

Personal experiences should not be considered universally applicable to all patients.

