## Recommendation

If you have diabetes or suspect that you may have diabetes, consult your physician or endocrinologist before making any changes to:

* medication;
* insulin therapy;
* diet;
* physical activity;
* lifestyle.

---

## Scientific Development

Medical science evolves continuously.

The information presented in this repository may become outdated as new scientific evidence emerges.

Users are encouraged to consult current clinical guidelines and peer-reviewed medical literature.

